Multi-line headings

```
# Title
outside
.
<section id="title-outside">
  <h1>Title
outside</h1>
</section>
```

```
# Title
- item
.
<section id="title">
  <h1>Title</h1>
  <ul>
    <li>item</li>
  </ul>
</section>
```

```
# Title
1. one
.
<section id="title-1-one">
  <h1>Title
1. one</h1>
</section>
```
